  "content": "\n\n<p>本模组为 Croptopia 与 Farmer's Delight 增加了兼容性。最核心的改动是：所有原本使用 Farmer's Delight 烹饪锅的配方，现在均可使用 Croptopia 的烹饪锅制作，反之亦然。</p>\n<p>此外，我们对部分配方进行了微调，以确保一个模组中的物品能够正常兼容至另一个模组。</p>\n<p>想为你喜爱的附属模组申请兼容性支持？<a href=\"https://github.com/ACCBDD/farmers-croptopia/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">前往 GitHub 提交 Issue。</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>当前支持：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>1.20.1</th>\n<th>1.21.1</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Croptopia</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Farmer's Delight</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ender's Delight</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rustic Delight</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Seed Delight</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Nether's Delight</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Delightful</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Crabber's Delight</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Vintage Delight</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Casualness Delight</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>More Delight</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fruits Delight</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Oceanic Delight</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Brewin' and Chewin'</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cultural Delights</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Veggies Delight</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>My Nether's Delight</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Miner's Delight</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Farmer's Respite</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fwilliamnottell\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/ACCBDD-white?style=flat-square&logo=kofi\" alt=\"Ko-Fi\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/kVj8w5ne46\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1290921259848437781?style=flat-square&logo=discord&label=Discord&labelColor=222222&color=5865f2\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p>",
